OL,4,CPet Shop Boys and Biffy Clyro to       
OL,5,Cheadline Tramlines 2027                
OL,6,GPet Shop Boys, Biffy Clyro and Two     
OL,7,GDoor Cinema Club will headline         
OL,8,GSheffield's Tramlines music festival   
OL,9,Gnext summer, organisers have confirmed.
OL,11,FThe festival, first held in 2009 and   
OL,12,Fwhich this year welcomed about 40,000  
OL,13,Fmusic fans, will take place in         
OL,14,FHillsborough Park in Sheffield between 
OL,15,F23-25 July.                            
OL,17,FOther artists on the bill include The  
OL,18,FKooks, Ash, Natalie Imbruglia,         
OL,19,FInhaler, Groove Armada, Vengaboys and  
OL,20,FRazorlight.                            
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
