OL,4,CVandals target heritage railway line   
OL,5,GA train on a heritage railway in North 
OL,6,GYorkshire has been targeted by         
OL,7,Gvandals, its manager said.             
OL,9,FVandals are thought to have trespassed 
OL,10,Fon railway tracks on the Wensleydale   
OL,11,FRailway line on Thursday night and     
OL,12,Fgraffitied a 1980s Pacer, which was    
OL,13,Fparked near Bedale.                    
OL,15,FWhile the damage was painted over by   
OL,16,Fthe railway's operations staff the     
OL,17,Ffollowing day, the incident was        
OL,18,Fdescribed as "incredibly frustrating"  
OL,19,Fand "so dangerous".                    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
